  "notable_quotes": [
    "Solvothermal reactions of Zn(II) or Cd(II) salts with AmTAZAc produced four coordination polymers containing in situ generated 3-amino-1,2,4-triazolate ligands.",
    "Replacing acetate with sulfate in the Zn system yields complex 2, an open 3D framework with octagonal-cylinder units and three kinds of 1D channels.",
    "Using Zn(II) with acetate gives [Zn(AmTAZ)(CH3COO)] (1), a two-dimensional framework built from Zn(II) ions and μ3-AmTAZ ligands."
